    rdfs:comment "Thermo-chemical process producing syngas or pyrolysis oil that may be used as feedstock for material production. Use of the output as fuel is energy recovery and is not represented as recycling."@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process> ;
